# Append-only accuracy log. Unit tests and mock-depth wiring runs write here
# by default; do not commit those rows. Real DA-V2 / SRTM numbers belong in
# an untracked local copy (or DEPTHWIZARD_ACCURACY_LOG) with an explicit
# model_id of depth-anything-v2-small — never treat mock R² as judge metrics.
docs/accuracy_log.jsonl

# Generated pipeline outputs and local test images
outputs/
samples/
